  "content": "<h3><strong>⚠公告：自2026年1月8日起，Heycronus團隊的所有專案將僅透過CurseForge、Modrinth和Planet Minecraft上的devHeycronus帳號正式發布及維護。</strong></h3><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3><strong>更好的梯子</strong>將經典的Minecraft梯子改造成精美的3D模型，為您的建築增添深度與真實感。每一階梯都經過精心重新設計，營造出更沉浸且細緻的外觀。</h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dLAEZJ6TS7CYP6%2526no_recurring%253d0%2526item_name%253dHelp%2bme%2bcontinue%2bwith%2bthe%2bprojects%2bwith%2ba%2bsimple%2bdonation%2b-%2bHeycronus%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1013293/description_41c410a1-3705-48e1-9d6d-faca354f3234.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"93\"></a></p><h3>此材質包也同時更新了梯子在介面（GUI）中的外觀，確保在整個遊戲中提供一致且精緻的視覺體驗。</h3><h3>升級您的世界，使用<em>更好的梯子</em>，以風格攀爬吧！</h3>",
